        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: साध्य करणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "साध्य करणे — sādhya karṇe — \"to achieve\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खूप कष्ट करून तिने तिचं ध्येय साध्य केलं. khūp kaṣṭa karūn tine ticaṁ dhyey sādhya kelaṁ. With much hard work she achieved her goal."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने ध्येय साध्य केलं, tyāne dhyey sādhya kelaṁ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "साध्य करणे (sādhya karṇe) is the tatsama साध्य, from Sanskrit sādhya, \"to be accomplished\" (Monier-Williams), with करणे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
